### ============================================
### ADMIN API
### ============================================
##1.Admin 
### 1.1[Admin] Login - ??????????? Admin
POST http://localhost:9091/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_PASSWORD}}",
    "rememberMe": false
}

### 1.2[Admin] Signup - ????? Admin ???? (????????????????????? Strapi)
POST http://localhost:9091/admin/register-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstname": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_FIRSTNAME}}",
    "lastname": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_LASTNAME}}",
    "email": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 1.3[Admin] Forgot Password - ??????????????
POST http://localhost:9091/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_EMAIL}}"
}

### 1.3.1[Admin] Reset Password - เปลี่ยน password ใหม่ (ได้ code จากอีเมล reset-password)
POST http://localhost:9091/admin/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "resetPasswordToken": "5d75614ba1d7cdef0031ed0cba2be21acaef609b",
    "password": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_PASSWORD}}"
}


### 1.4[Admin] Profile - ???????? Admin ???????? (??????? Token ??? Login)
GET http://localhost:9091/admin/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}


### ============================================
### USER API
### ============================================
##2.User
### 2.1[User] Login - ?????????????????
POST http://localhost:9091/api/auth/local
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "identifier": "{{$dotenv USER_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 2.2[User] Signup - ???????????????
POST http://localhost:9091/api/auth/local/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "john_doe",
    "email": "{{$dotenv USER_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 2.3[User] Forgot Password - ??????????????
POST http://localhost:9091/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{$dotenv USER_EMAIL}}"
}

### 2.3.1[User] Reset Password - ?????????????? (code ???????????? ?????????? password ??????)
POST http://localhost:9091/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "code": "0e6d454b71c991a3bd1a758c466fbcfd703ff6761a1d2575adfd699329ec3ae5608d2eb96ca6da697867b8b994eb88b24b11dfd8bec0a0dbfdc6f08e02d32e87",
    "password": "User1234",
    "passwordConfirmation": "User1234"
}

### 2.4[User] Profile - ?????????????????????? (??????? Token ??? Login)
GET http://localhost:9091/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_TOKEN}}

### ============================================
### CONTENT API (Content-Type Builder)
### ============================================
### Content API ใช้ Token ของ User ที่ Login ผ่าน 2.1 (Bearer {{$dotenv USER_TOKEN}})
### Create/Update ต้องห่อ field ด้วย { "data": { ... } } ตามหลัก Strapi v4/v5
### draftAndPublish (on): ไม่ระบุ "publishedAt" = ได้ Published (เห็นใน Get all)
###   ระบุ "publishedAt": null = เป็น Draft (ซ่อนจาก Get all, ต้องใช้ ?publicationState=preview)

## 3.Content
## 3.1 Student
### 3.1.1[Student] Create - สร้าง Student (name, mobile 10 หลัก, cardId 13 หลัก ห้ามซ้ำ)
POST http://localhost:9091/api/students
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "data": {
        "name": "สมชาย ใจดี",
        "mobile": "0812355678",
        "cardId": "1100055000000"
    }
}

### 3.1.2[Student] Get all - ดึง Student ทั้งหมด
GET http://localhost:9091/api/students
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_TOKEN}}

### 3.1.3[Student] Update - แก้ไขตาม id (id ได้จาก 3.1.2)
PUT http://localhost:9091/api/students/11
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "data": {
        "name": "สมชาย ใจดี ใหม่"
    }
}

### 3.1.4[Student] Delete - ลบตาม id
DELETE http://localhost:9091/api/students/11
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_TOKEN}}

### 3.1.5[Student] Get by ID - ดึง Student ตาม id
GET http://localhost:9091/api/students/11
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_TOKEN}}

## 3.2 Teacher
### 3.2.1[Teacher] Create - สร้าง Teacher (name บังคับ)
POST http://localhost:9091/api/teachers
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_TOKEN}}
