Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_TOKEN}}

### 3.3.3[Subject] Update - แก้ไขตาม id
PUT http://localhost:9091/api/subjects/7
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "data": {
        "name": "คณิตศาสตร์พื้นฐาน"
    }
}

### 3.3.4[Subject] Delete - ลบตาม id
DELETE http://localhost:9091/api/subjects/7
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_TOKEN}}

### 3.3.5[Subject] Get by ID - ดึง Subject ตาม id
GET http://localhost:9091/api/subjects/7
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_TOKEN}}